      "type": "layout.comment",
      "name": "Source, setup and scope",
      "description": "Disabled registered RGB-D acquisition template. All three topics must provide the same nonzero acquisition stamp and optical frame, with already registered color/depth pixels. CameraInfo uses rectified P intrinsics, identity R, no stereo baseline translation. Choose the exact depth scale; uint16 defaults to 0.001 m/sample, floats to meters. Coordinator queues matching tickets for two seconds, then discards incomplete sets. Header equality does not prove clock synchronization or registration. No TF lookup, simulator or robot motion is performed.",
